  DisplayNameEN: Berserker's Skull
  DisplayNameRU: "\u0427\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043F \u0411\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0435\u0440\u043A\u0430"
  DescriptionEN: "Activate to enter a rage for a limited time: damage dealt to enemies
